TITLE:: ProbeLoudness
summary:: ITU-R BS.1770-4 / EBU R128 real-time loudness meter
categories:: GUI>Visuals
related:: Classes/Probe, Classes/ProbeLoudnessView, Classes/ProbeMeter, Classes/ProbeLoudnessSource

DESCRIPTION::
ProbeLoudness provides an ITU-R BS.1770-4 and EBU R128 compliant real-time loudness meter.
It features two-stage K-weighting (high-shelf acoustic head model filter and RLB high-pass filter),
triple vertical meters (M, S, I), dual-gated integrated program loudness, and comprehensive numeric metrics.

list::
## strong::Momentary (M)::: 400 ms sliding window power measurement
## strong::Short-Term (S)::: 3.0 s sliding window power measurement
## strong::Integrated (I)::: Dual-gated program loudness with -70 LUFS absolute threshold and -10 LU relative threshold
## strong::Loudness Range (LRA)::: 95th minus 10th percentile distribution of short-term blocks
## strong::Target Reference Line::: Configurable target line (-23 LUFS broadcast standard or -14 LUFS streaming standard)
## strong::Max Peak::: Unwindowed sample peak tracking
## strong::Measurement Broker::: Multiple loudness meters or dashboard instances share a single analysis synth
::

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Creates and displays a new ProbeLoudness window.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target link::Classes/Server:: (defaults to code::Server.default::).

ARGUMENT:: busType
Bus category to monitor: code::\outputs::, code::\inputs::, or code::\bus::.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio bus offset (default 0).

ARGUMENT:: numChannels
Number of channels (1 for mono, 2 for stereo).

ARGUMENT:: theme
Theme name symbol (e.g. code::\graphite::) or link::Classes/ProbeTheme:: instance.

ARGUMENT:: targetLUFS
Target reference loudness in LUFS (default -23.0, or -14.0).

ARGUMENT:: updateFreq
Measurement update rate in Hz (default 10 Hz).

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: window
Returns the underlying link::Classes/Window::.

METHOD:: loudnessView
Returns the underlying link::Classes/ProbeLoudnessView::.

METHOD:: theme
Update active theme dynamically.

ARGUMENT:: aTheme
Theme symbol or link::Classes/ProbeTheme::.

METHOD:: fontScale
Get or set the active typography scaling factor.

ARGUMENT:: aScale
Float font scale between 0.6 and 2.5.

METHOD:: targetLUFS
Update target reference line and delta calculation.

ARGUMENT:: val
Target loudness float value.

METHOD:: toggleTarget
Toggle between -23.0 LUFS (EBU R128) and -14.0 LUFS (Streaming).

METHOD:: reset
Reset integrated loudness history and peak hold metrics (also triggered via keyboard 'r').

METHOD:: toggleFreeze
Toggle pause/unpause of meter updates (also triggered via Space bar).

METHOD:: close
Close window and release broker subscriptions.

EXAMPLES::

code::
s.boot;
x = { SinOsc.ar(1000) * 0.07108 ! 2 }.play; // Calibrated -23 LUFS tone
m = Probe.loudness(s, \outputs, 0, 2, \graphite, -23.0);
::
